 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 지역특화산업육성+(R&amp;D)사업&nbsp;:<b> 3. 15.(수)&nbsp;∼ 3. 29.(수)&nbsp;(온라인접수시스템 http://www.smtech.go.kr)</b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. 중소기업기술혁신개발사업&nbsp; &nbsp; :<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> </span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">4. 24.(월)&nbsp;∼ 5. 16.(화</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)&nbsp; (온라인접수시스템 http://www.iris.go.kr)</span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;대상사업 : 수출지향형, 시장대응형(재도약), 소부장일반</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3. 중소기업기술혁신개발사업 :&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">4. 24.(월)&nbsp;∼ 5. 16.(화)&nbsp; (온라인접수시스템 http://www.smtech.go.kr)</span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;대상사업 : 시장확대형(후불형)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나. 온라인시스템(IRIS시스템) 제출 사전 준비 사항</span></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1.</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;연구자, 기관총괄담당자. 기관담당자, 기관대표자, 지원기관 실무자 등은 IRIS회원가</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">입 및 국가연구자번호 발급 완료 후 소속기관을 해당기관으로 설정</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. 과제 접수 전, 모든 참여 연구개발기관의 연구책임자의 학력 및 경력 정보는 국가연구자정보시스템(NRI)에 반드시 입력되어야 함.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; (IRIS시스템 QUICK LINK : 국가연구자정보시스템 참고)</span></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">* 신청 서식(사업 별) - 작성 용(예시 포함) 파일을 참고하셔서 연구 개발 계획서 작성 요망.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;기타 문의 사항은 센터(478 - 6672</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">∼</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">6677)로 문의해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
